app
  ctrl+c  ^c  quit  on
  ?       ?   help  on

actions
  ]            ]          tab            on
  [            [          previous tab   on
  tab ]        tab        pane           on
  shift+tab [  shift+tab  previous pane  on
  l            l          pane right     on
  h            h          pane left      on
  f            f          filter         on
  z            z          zoom           on
  o            o          browser        on
  ctrl+r       ^r         rerun failed   on
  R            R          rerun all      on
  J            J          rerun job      off
  x            x          cancel run     off
  r ctrl+r     r          refresh        on
  esc          esc        close          on
  enter        ↵          jobs           on
  A            A          annotations    off

runs
  up k      ↑/k     up         on
  down j    ↓/j     down       on
  pgup b    pgup/b  page up    on
  pgdown f  pgdn/f  page down  on
  home g    g/home  first      on
  end G     G/end   last       on
  r ctrl+r  r       retry      off
